ntsync-live: adaptive spin (spin_adaptive)

Per gated thread, the outcomes of its last 4 waits (short: over within spin_ns) index 16 two-bit saturating
counters; a wait spins only when its counter is at least 2, so a thread alternating one long wait with short
ones (Live's workers between and within blocks) does not spin on the long one. The predictor learns from
every gated wait, spun or not; stats gains skipped. Off by default.

